clueweb09-en0006-55-07966.0 Martha Washington Library Will Close For Renovation December 20 -- FCPL [Fairfax County, Virginia] [Fairfax County] Search Site: Home Living Here Doing Business Visiting Departments & Agencies [*] Martha Washington Library Will Close For Renovation December 20 [*] you are here:homepage > library > news releases > news release [*] Home Account Services Research Tools Catalog Databases Events Library Branches Good Reading About the Library Site Index For Immediate Release: November 24, 2008 Contact: Mary Mulrenan 703-324-8319 The Martha Washington Library will close at 5:00 p.m. Saturday, December 20 for renovation. The library will open in temporary quarters in mid-February 2009. Renovations to the branch are expected to take a minimum of 18 months. The temporary site for Martha Washington Library will be 6328 Richmond Highway, Unit F, Alexandria, VA 22306. While the Martha Washington Library is closed, customers can visit any of the nearby branches including Sherwood Regional Library at 2501 Sherwood Hall Lane in Alexandria, 703-765-3645; John Marshall Library
