clueweb09-en0005-75-10945.0 CALS online catalog | employment opportunities | contribute to cals | contact us CALS Location Index aerospace library cox creative center dee brown library fletcher library main library maumelle library mcmath library milam library nixon library river market books & gifts sanders library terry library thompson library williams library Amy Sanders Library 31 Shelby Drive Sherwood , AR 72120 501-835-7756 Map and Directions Hours: 9:30 a.m.-6:00 p.m. Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Saturday 9:30 a.m.-8:00 p.m. Tuesday and Thursday Branch Manager: Ginann Swindle Amy Sanders Library opened to serve Sherwood residents in 1989. In addition to an array of books and audio/visual equipment, the library offers numerous children’s programs. Sherwood’s Master Gardeners have provided landscaping to accentuate the 9,800-square-feet facility. People of the Library Amy Sanders served as Sherwood city clerk for more than 14 years. She was honored in 1988 by having the library, which was under construction, named for her.
